<title>USA: Everest Medical CEO Shannon elected chairman.</title>
<headline>Everest Medical CEO Shannon elected chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Everest Medical Corp , an electrosurgery instrument maker, said Thursday its chief executive officer, John Shannon Jr, had been elected chairman of the board.</p>
<p>As chairman, Shannon succeeds David Koentopf, who remains a director, the company said.</p>
<p>Everest shares were down 1/8 at 2-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
